Subject: [PATCH] cli: include native backhaul AP identity in BSS inventory

Native AP metrics already contain backhaul BSSID reports. Hiding these APs
from /bsses prevents observers from verifying their device, radio and channel.
Include AP-mode entries from the existing controller tree, never station-mode
copies or unknown modes. Identity and channel still come from the owning native
radio; no load, capacity or candidate quality is inferred. Client candidate
selection retains its independent fronthaul SSID filter.

Upstream-Status: Pending
